{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ratio\" title=\"Ratio\">ratio</a> of boys to girls in Mr. Brown's math class is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/b/37bac8710233ca570649f0526e28b1a1ebb69d1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2:3$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />.  If there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> students in the class, how many more girls than boys are in the class?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/4/514510ef939fd9b29381198729993236856310cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"339\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be half the number of boys.  Then there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec701493fa72dda5d6747fe14f30e7b1c2fb6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> boys and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e634348f8df9eaeac4ced35db64d08a906532e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> girls. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/2/f824d234384dae9ae81d71b8b43d0efa6ebbfe42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+3x=5x=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"149\" height=\"15\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea7da1b75cc1a945018db7316c26d618ca11ff9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, between the number of girls and the number of boys is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/6/9d6fda4fc64e88cf779fdecf0821226ef461cc35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x-2x=x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"177\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the ratio of boys to girls is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/5/bf5aca1df088f2be27fdbbb5edabf5830f9e8d30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 : 3$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/a/94aa438676588ff0b79b8122bf814eed5091ab64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{2+3} = \\frac{2}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"84\" height=\"40\" /> of the students are boys and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/c/76c7a76310ed2f4ad35b91828d4cec33e7347044.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{2+3} = \\frac{3}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"84\" height=\"40\" /> are girls.  Thus the difference between the number of boys and the number of girls is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/e/2ceba05f8489fc67e893dae825ab387015051f03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{5} - \\frac{2}{5} = \\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" /> of the number of students in the class, that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/d/30d7b22dc3a1294b0d6bdeed767e29846b48eef2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{5} \\cdot 30 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"126\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/UkTqNBFHJaA\">https://youtu.be/UkTqNBFHJaA</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME\" title=\"1985 AJHSME\">1985 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017041515\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 140/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2302/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nE